# Omnidrone stage 1: OptiTrack as the only navigation source.
# Target: ArduPilot Copter 4.7.1 on the Cube Orange (audit 2026-11-04: GPS + compass active, VISO off).
# Source: ArduPilot wiki "OptiTrack for Non-GPS Navigation" (common-optitrack).
# Safe to load before the 6DoF frame change: it touches sensors/EKF only, no motor outputs.
#
# Mission Planner: Config > Full Parameter List > Load from file > review highlighted rows > Write Params > reboot.
# VISO_POS_M_NSE / VISO_YAW_M_NSE only exist after VISO_TYPE=1 and a reboot: load this file a second time.
AHRS_EKF_TYPE,3
EK3_ENABLE,1
VISO_TYPE,1
EK3_SRC1_POSXY,6
EK3_SRC1_VELXY,0
EK3_SRC1_POSZ,6
EK3_SRC1_VELZ,0
EK3_SRC1_YAW,6
COMPASS_USE,0
COMPASS_USE2,0
COMPASS_USE3,0
GPS1_TYPE,0
VISO_POS_M_NSE,0.1
VISO_YAW_M_NSE,0.1
